<div class="rug-panel--content">
<span class="rug-panel--content__meta"><strong>Bachelor</strong> - full-time</span>
<h1 class="rug-h2">Data Science &amp; Society</h1>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Content -->
<div class="rug-background-white rug-pt">
<div class="rug-wrapper">
<div class="rug-layout rug-layout--l">
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-13-24">
<div class="rug-theme--content">
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p class="rug-lead">Is data the new oil? Can facial recognition technology
discriminate against you? Join our programme as we explore these
questions while future-proofing your career with in-demand data
skills.</p>
<div>✔️ Build <strong>programming skills</strong> while
paying attention to social, ethical and political aspects of
<em>datafication</em>
                  
<br>
✔️ Learn from international <strong>lecturers with
different areas of expertise</strong>, from governance to data
visualization<br>
✔️ <strong>Develop as a data professional</strong> by
learning how to present data-based insights<br>
                  
<span>
                     <span>✔️ Choose
between <strong>two</strong>
                     </span>
                     <strong>specialisations</strong>:</span>
                  <em>AI and Society</em> or
<em>Cognitive Technology</em>
                  
<br>
                  
<br>
                  
<em>Want to learn more and stay up to date with the
programme?</em>
                  
<br>
&rarr; <a href="https://confirmsubscription.com/h/j/72F4EE3529EF3A3F" target="_blank">Sign up
for the monthly newsletter</a>
                  
<br>
                  
<span>&rarr;</span>
                  <span>
                     <a href="/cf/campus-fryslan/bloggen/">Explore
student stories</a>
                  </span>
                  
<br>
&rarr; <a href="/cf/education/beurzen/studiefondsen?lang=en">Discover
available scholarships</a>
                  
<br>
                  
<br>
For the <strong>second time in just three years</strong> since its
launch, the BSc in Data Science &amp; Society has been voted a
<strong>top-rated programme in the Netherlands</strong>!<br>
                  
<br>
                  
