<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="nastudie-accordion" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="afterstudies">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">After your studies</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="afterstudies"></a>
<div>
<div>Graduates of the <strong>BSc in Data Science &amp; Society</strong>
leave the programme equipped with a unique combination of skills
that employers actively seek. You will master <strong>data
analysis, AI, law, ethics, policy, and communication</strong>,
making you a versatile problem-solver who can bridge the gap
between technical teams and decision-makers.<br>
                           
<br>
The programme emphasizes <strong>real-world experience</strong>,
giving you the opportunity to work on projects with <strong>local
municipalities, NGOs, and companies</strong>. These projects allow
you to build a portfolio of tangible results, from optimizing
production lines to designing sustainable urban policies, that
demonstrates your ability to deliver impact from day one.<br>
Career paths for graduates are diverse and in high demand.<br>
                           
<br>
Graduates also benefit from the programme's strong <strong>network
of research collaborations, internships, and regional innovation
partners</strong>, which often helps students secure positions even
before completing the degree. With this combination of
<strong>skills, experience, and connections</strong>, you are
prepared to work in <strong>tech, policy, sustainability, or to
launch your own venture</strong>, ready to thrive in a rapidly
changing job market.<br>
                           
<br>
                        
</div>
</div>
<h2>Job prospects</h2>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>Naar data-experts is veel vraag, dus je kunt veel kanten op.
Tijdens je studie leer je samenwerken en communiceren met mensen
uit andere vakgebieden. Je begrijpt niet alleen de data, maar ook
wat die betekent vanuit verschillende invalshoeken. En je kunt dat
helder uitleggen. Via praktijkopdrachten leg je bovendien contacten
met mogelijke werkgevers.</p>
                        
</div>
<div>Om je een idee te geven van hoe jouw toekomstige loopbaan eruit zou
kunnen zien, hebben we deze <a href="https://www.rug.nl/cf/studeren-bij-cf/programmas/dss-career-visual-1.pdf" target="_blank">infographic</a>
voor je gemaakt.<br>
                           
<br>
                        
</div>
</div>
<h2>Job examples</h2>
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
<strong>Data Engineer</strong>
<div>
                           
<p>A Data Engineer develops, builds, tests, and maintains digital
architectures, such as databases and large-scale processing
systems. This is a more technical role focused on designing
applications and data infrastructures.</p>
                        
</div>
</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
<strong>Data Scientist</strong>
<div>
                           
<p>An increasing number of organisations is hiring Data Scientists.
They work on designing and constructing new processes for data
modeling and production using prototypes, algorithms, predictive
models, and custom analysis. This is relevant to solving problems
in the business and governance domain.</p>
                        
</div>
</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
<strong>Data Analyst</strong>
<div>
                           
<p>Companies and organizations increasingly need data analysts.
They analyze data to uncover insights that might otherwise be
overlooked. The data tells a story that they understand and can
share with others in the organization. This way, smart decisions
can be made that truly make a difference.</p>
                        
</div>
</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
<strong>Data Protection Officer</strong>
<div>
                           
<p>A Data Protection Officer ensures that an organization processes
the personal data of its staff, customers, providers or any other
individuals (also referred to as data subjects) in compliance with
the applicable data protection rules.</p>
                        
</div>
</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
<strong>Policy Advisor</strong>
<div>
                           
<p>A Policy Advisor is a professional who provides ideas or plans
that are used by an organization or government as a basis for
making decisions.</p>
                        
</div>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="onderzoek-accordion" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="research">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">Research</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="research"></a>
<div>
<h3>Data Science &amp; Society and research</h3>
<div>
                           
<p>Lecturers, researchers, and partners of the DSS programme
collaborate on diverse projects at the University of Groningen's
Jantina Tammes School of Digital Society, Technology and AI, and at
Campus Frysl&acirc;n's Data Research Centre.</p>
                        
</div>
<div>The <strong>Jantina Tammes School</strong> explores how societies
can benefit from and shape digital technologies and artificial
intelligence, guided by its motto: <em>&ldquo;digital prosperity
for all.&rdquo;</em> The <strong>Data Research Centre</strong>
focuses on three core areas: <strong>Data Governance, Security and
Human Rights</strong>; <strong>Human-Data Interaction</strong>; and
<strong>Data Applications and Organisations</strong>. It provides a
collaborative space where researchers, students, and external
partners co-create knowledge and investigate the societal
implications of data science.<br>
                           
<br>
Students are actively involved in this ecosystem, gaining hands-on
experience through lectures, workshops, and events organised by
both institutions.<br>
                           
<br>
                        
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-background-white rug-pv">
<div class="rug-wrapper">
<div class="js--id-foldout-container rug-pl-0 rug-button--foldout">
<a class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__big rug-button--foldout__secondary rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--large js--analytics" data-foldout-nopanel="true" href="/cf/education/application/applying-for-the-bsc-data-science-society" name="apply" data-hash-name="apply" target="_blank" data-category="inschrijven" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society"><span class="rug-icon rug-icon--check-square rug-icon--xxl rug-block rug-pv-s"></span>Apply now<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml-xs" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__big rug-button--foldout__secondary rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--large js--analytics" data-foldout-nopanel="true" href="https://confirmsubscription.com/h/j/0714DA06024D99D7" name="brochure" data-hash-name="brochure" target="_blank" data-category="brochure" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society"><span class="rug-icon rug-icon--pdf rug-icon--xxl rug-block rug-pv-s"></span>Brochure<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml-xs" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a data-foldout-class="rug-button--foldout__active" data-id="foldout-3" class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__big rug-button--foldout__secondary rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--large js--analytics" data-hash-name="events" name="events" data-category="evenementen" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society"><span class="rug-icon rug-icon rug-icon--star rug-icon--xxl rug-block rug-pv-s"></span>Events<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml-xs" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a data-foldout-class="rug-button--foldout__active" data-id="foldout-4" class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__big rug-button--foldout__secondary rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--large js--analytics" data-hash-name="contact" name="contact" data-category="contact" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society"><span class="rug-icon rug-icon rug-icon--mail rug-icon--xxl rug-block rug-pv-s"></span>Contact<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml-xs" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
<div data-id="panel-3" class="rug-panel rug-panel--foldout">
<div class="rug-layout rug-col-s-12-24 rug-col-l-6-24">
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-mb">
<div class="rug-media">
<div class="rug-media__date">
<time class="rug-date rug-date--subtle rug-date--transparent" datetime="Oct-30">
<span class="rug-date__day">30</span>Oct</time>
