						Testimonial of Freark de Lange"><div class="rug-showcase__slide__blockquote-container">
<blockquote class="rug-blockquote">The flexibility that professors offer in structuring assignments around your own interests allows me to explore topics I am actually interested in. I want to work in the aerospace sector and I have already been able to work with satellite data.<footer class="rug-blockquote__attribution">
								&ndash; Freark de Lange</footer>
</blockquote>
