<div class="rug-showcase__slide rug-showcase__slide--quoted-image">
<img src="https://www.rug.nl/cf/images/hodex/imaji.png" alt="
						Testimonial of Imaji Rizal"><div class="rug-showcase__slide__blockquote-container">
<blockquote class="rug-blockquote">I saw the growing relevance and necessity of data science in different fields. I have always seen myself as someone who cares for the community. This programme allows me to do just so, by learning to responsibly work with data.<footer class="rug-blockquote__attribution">
								&ndash; Imaji Rizal</footer>
</blockquote>
