<div class="rug-background-white rug-pt">
<div class="rug-wrapper">
<div class="rug-layout rug-layout--l">
<div class="rug-layout__item">
<div data-anchor="study-associations" class="rug-read-more">
<div class="rug-read-more__container">
<div class="rug-read-more__content">
<a id="study-associations"></a>
<h2 class="">Study associations</h2>
<div class="">
<h3 class="rug-mt">Nobis Cura Futuri</h3>
<div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>Nobis Cura Futuri is the Study Association and the official
embodiment of the international student community at Campus
Frysl&acirc;n.</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>Founded in 2020, we aim to provide plenty of fun, social and
academic events (think of Pub crawls, talent shows, travels,
guest-speaker evenings). All in the spirit of Nobis Cura Futuri:
&ldquo;The Care of the Future is Ours&rdquo;, meaning we strive to
provide activities that are aimed at making the most of your
student life by adhering to our values of responsibility,
diversity, sustainability and development.</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
</div>
<a href="https://www.sa-ncf.com/" target="_blank" xml:lang="en">https://www.sa-ncf.com/</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<button aria-hidden="true" class="rug-read-more__toggle"><span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-read-more__open-label">Read more</span><span class="rug-read-more__closed-label">Read less</span></button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-background-white rug-pv">
<div class="rug-wrapper">
<div class="rug-button--foldout js--id-foldout-container">
<a data-foldout-class="rug-button--foldout__active" data-id="foldout-N20B57" class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__medium rug-button rug-button--neutral rug-button--medium js--analytics" data-hash-name="profile" name="profile" data-category="studentprofiel-extrainfo" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society">Student profile<span class="rug-icon rug-pv-s rug-pl-xs rug-icon--user2"></span></a>
<div data-id="panel-N20B57" class="rug-panel rug-panel--foldout">
<div>
<div>
                  
<p>We are looking for students who are eager to use data to make a
real impact. Our students are typically:</p>
               
</div>
<div>
                  
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
                     
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                        
<strong>Problem-solvers at heart</strong>: You don't just
analyse data&mdash;you use it to tackle real-world issues like
social inequality, discrimination, or sustainability.</li>
                     
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                        
<strong>Curious about tech and society</strong>: You love
coding, statistics, and AI, but are equally fascinated by how data
shapes people and policies.</li>
                     
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                        
<strong>Collaborative and hands-on</strong>: You thrive in team
projects, working with peers, NGOs, startups, and the public sector
to turn data into action from day one.</li>
                     
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                        
<strong>Ambitious and distinctive</strong>: You want a degree
that goes beyond a generic &ldquo;data science&rdquo; label,
combining technical skills with knowledge of law, ethics, policy,
and communication.</li>
                     
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">
                        
<strong>Community-oriented and adventurous</strong>: You seek a
university and city that feel like home, with close-knit support,
dynamic student life, and opportunities for internships, research,
and career growth.<br>
                        
<br>
This programme is for doers, thinkers, and changemakers. If this
sounds like you, welcome home. Curious to experience it yourself?
<strong>Join a Student for a Day event!</strong>
                     
</li>
                  
</ul>
               
</div>
</div>
</div>
<a data-foldout-class="rug-button--foldout__active" data-id="foldout-N20B95" class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__medium rug-button rug-button--neutral rug-button--medium js--analytics" data-hash-name="advice" name="advice" data-category="advies-extrainfo" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society">(Binding) study advice<span class="rug-icon rug-pv-s rug-pl-xs  rug-icon--clipboard"></span></a>
<div data-id="panel-N20B95" class="rug-panel rug-panel--foldout">
<div>
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item"> A minimum of 45  EC in the first 12 months  (binding)</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div>
<div>
                     
<p>You will be offered study advice after the first year of study.
You can expect a positive result if you have earned more than 45
ECTS credit points (out of a total of 60 ECTS). If you have earned
fewer than 45 ECTS and are issued a negative result, you will not
be allowed to continue with your degree programme.</p>
                  
</div>
<div>You will receive preliminary study advice in December to make sure
that you know where you stand. Please contact your study advisor as
soon as possible if you have any questions about the BSA system.
N.B. Some degree programmes use a tutoring system; please check
with your study advisor.</div>
</div>
</div>
<a data-foldout-class="rug-button--foldout__active" data-id="foldout-N20BC3" class="js--button-foldout rug-button--foldout__medium rug-button rug-button--neutral rug-button--medium js--analytics" data-hash-name="related" name="related" data-category="aansluitende_masters-extrainfo" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Data Science &amp; Society">Related master's programmes<span class="rug-icon rug-pv-s rug-pl-xs  rug-icon--book"></span></a>
<div data-id="panel-N20BC3" class="rug-panel rug-panel--foldout">
<div class="rug-mb-l">
